  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Travel of Slovak Experts to Montenegro</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Vyslanie expertov zo Slovenska do &#x10c;iernej Hory</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">&lt;p&gt;D&#xf4;sledn&#xe1; person&#xe1;lna pr&#xed;prava &#x10d;iernohorsk&#xfd;ch diplomatov na p&#xf4;sobenie v Aliancii &#x2013; &#x201e;1. De&#x148; plnopr&#xe1;vneho &#x10d;lenstva &#x10c;H v NATO&#x201c;; sk&#xfa;senosti slovenskej diplomacie z &#x10d;ias vstupu SR do NATO. Z&#xe1;ujem rezortu zahrani&#x10d;n&#xfd;ch vec&#xed; a eur&#xf3;pskych integr&#xe1;ci&#xed; &#x10c;H, rezortu obrany a G&#x160; Arm&#xe1;dy &#x10c;H o sk&#xfa;senosti SR.&#xa0;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Preparation of Montenegrin diplomats personnel to operate in NATO - Slovak diplomacy experience from the time of Slovakia&apos;s accession to NATO.&#xa0;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
